data: {
    "logs": "\u001b[35m[Finalize] todos_count=0, todos_with_results=0\u001b[0m\n\u256d\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 \u2705 Agent Final Answer \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u256e\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  Agent: Universal Cloud Architect                                            \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  Final Answer:                                                               \u2502\n\u2502  PROJECT_SLUG: azure-aks-public-production                                   \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  ### Architecture Overview                                                   \u2502\n\u2502  This architecture deploys a production-ready Azure Kubernetes Service       \u2502\n\u2502  (AKS) cluster with public API access. It utilizes Azure CNI, Managed        \u2502\n\u2502  Identity, and Workload Identity. Networking is handled via a dedicated      \u2502\n\u2502  VNet with an associated NSG. Monitoring is integrated via a Log Analytics   \u2502\n\u2502  Workspace.                                                                  \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  ```mermaid                                                                  \u2502\n\u2502  graph TD                                                                    \u2502\n\u2502      subgraph Azure_Cloud                                                    \u2502\n\u2502          VNet[Virtual Network]                                               \u2502\n\u2502          Subnet[AKS Subnet]                                                  \u2502\n\u2502          NSG[Network Security Group]                                         \u2502\n\u2502          LAW[Log Analytics Workspace]                                        \u2502\n\u2502          ACR[Azure Container Registry]                                       \u2502\n\u2502          AKS[AKS Cluster]                                                    \u2502\n\u2502          MI[Managed Identity]                                                \u2502\n\u2502      end                                                                     \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502      VNet --> Subnet                                                         \u2502\n\u2502      Subnet --> NSG                                                          \u2502\n\u2502      Subnet --> AKS                                                          \u2502\n\u2502      AKS --> LAW                                                             \u2502\n\u2502      AKS --> ACR                                                             \u2502\n\u2502      AKS --> MI                                                              \u2502\n\u2502      AKS -.-> RoleAssignment[ACR Pull Role]                                  \u2502\n\u2502  ```                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  ### Terraform Configuration                                                 \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  #### versions.tf                                                            \u2502\n\u2502  ```hcl                                                                      \u2502\n\u2502  terraform {                                                                 \u2502\n\u2502    required_version = \">= 1.6.0\"                                             \u2502\n\u2502    required_providers {                                                      \u2502\n\u2502      azurerm = {                                                             \u2502\n\u2502        source  = \"hashicorp/azurerm\"                                         \u2502\n\u2502        version = \">= 4.0.0\"                                                  \u2502\n\u2502      }                                                                       \u2502\n\u2502    }                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  provider \"azurerm\" {                                                        \u2502\n\u2502    features {}                                                               \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502  ```                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  #### variables.tf                                                           \u2502\n\u2502  ```hcl                                                                      \u2502\n\u2502  variable \"resource_group_name\" { type = string }                            \u2502\n\u2502  variable \"location\" { type = string }                                       \u2502\n\u2502  variable \"prefix\" { type = string }                                         \u2502\n\u2502  ```                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  #### main.tf                                                                \u2502\n\u2502  ```hcl                                                                      \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_resource_group\" \"main\" {                                  \u2502\n\u2502    name     = \"${var.prefix}-rg\"                                             \u2502\n\u2502    location = var.location                                                   \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_log_analytics_workspace\" \"main\" {                         \u2502\n\u2502    name                = \"${var.prefix}-logs\"                                \u2502\n\u2502    location            = azurerm_resource_group.main.location                \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name = azurerm_resource_group.main.name                    \u2502\n\u2502    sku                 = \"PerGB2018\"                                         \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_virtual_network\" \"main\" {                                 \u2502\n\u2502    name                = \"${var.prefix}-vnet\"                                \u2502\n\u2502    address_space       = [\"10.0.0.0/16\"]                                     \u2502\n\u2502    location            = azurerm_resource_group.main.location                \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name = azurerm_resource_group.main.name                    \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_subnet\" \"aks\" {                                           \u2502\n\u2502    name                 = \"aks-subnet\"                                       \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name  = azurerm_resource_group.main.name                   \u2502\n\u2502    virtual_network_name = azurerm_virtual_network.main.name                  \u2502\n\u2502    address_prefixes     = [\"10.0.1.0/24\"]                                    \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_container_registry\" \"main\" {                              \u2502\n\u2502    name                = replace(\"${var.prefix}acr\", \"-\", \"\")                \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name = azurerm_resource_group.main.name                    \u2502\n\u2502    location            = azurerm_resource_group.main.location                \u2502\n\u2502    sku                 = \"Standard\"                                          \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  data \"azurerm_kubernetes_service_versions\" \"current\" {                      \u2502\n\u2502    location = azurerm_resource_group.main.location                           \u2502\n\u2502  }                                                                           \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  resource \"azurerm_kubernetes_cluster\" \"aks\" {                               \u2502\n\u2502    name                = \"${var.prefix}-aks\"                                 \u2502\n\u2502    location            = azurerm_resource_group.main.location                \u2502\n\u2502    resource_group_name = azurerm_resource_group.main.name                    \u2502\n\u2502    dns_prefix          = \"${var.prefix}-dns\"                                 \u2502\n\u2502    kubernetes_version  =                                                     \u2502\n\u2502  data.azurerm_kubernetes_service_versions.current.latest_version             \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502    identity { type = \"SystemAssigned\" }                                      \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502    default_node_pool {                                                       \u2502\n\u2502      name                = \"system\"                                          \u2502\n\u2502      vm_size             = \"Standard_D16s_v5\"                                \u2502\n\u2502      enable_auto_scaling = true                                              \u2502\n\u2502      min_count           = 2                                                 \u2502\n\u2502      max_count           = 5                                                 \u2502\n\u2502      vnet_subnet_id      = azurerm_subnet.aks.id                             \u2502\n\u2502    }                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502    network_profile {                                                         \u2502\n\u2502      network_plugin = \"azure\"                                                \u2502\n\u2502    }                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502    oidc_issuer_enabled       = true                                          \u2502\n\u2502    workload_identity_enabled = true                                          \u2502\n\u2502    role_based_access_control_enabled = true               