icy_enabled` is set to `true`    \u2502\n\u2502  and that `disk_encryption_set_id` is configured for the node pools to       \u2502\n\u2502  ensure data at rest is encrypted with customer-managed keys.                \u2502\n\u2502  *   **Requirement:** Ensure that `secret_rotation` is enabled if using      \u2502\n\u2502  Azure Key Vault integration with the Secrets Store CSI Driver.              \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  **C. ACR (Container Registry)**                                             \u2502\n\u2502  *   **Requirement:** Ensure `public_network_access_enabled` is set to       \u2502\n\u2502  `false`. Use Azure Private Link to connect to the ACR from the AKS          \u2502\n\u2502  cluster.                                                                    \u2502\n\u2502  *   **Requirement:** Enable \"Content Trust\" and \"Registry Quarantine\" to    \u2502\n\u2502  prevent the deployment of unsigned or malicious images.                     \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  **D. Identity & Access**                                                    \u2502\n\u2502  *   **Requirement:** The AKS cluster must use **Azure AD integrated with    \u2502\n\u2502  RBAC** rather than local accounts. Ensure                                   \u2502\n\u2502  `role_based_access_control_enabled` is `true` and                           \u2502\n\u2502  `azure_active_directory_role_based_access_control` is properly configured.  \u2502\n\u2502  *   **Requirement:** Ensure the cluster uses **Managed Identities** rather  \u2502\n\u2502  than Service Principals for all Azure resource interactions.                \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  ---                                                                         \u2502\n\u2502                 